# D17/I21:刪掉唯一 primary 後,主支軸由 boundary 推得(不是回到未定義)。
# 角材 1 沿 u → 主支軸 = v;角材 2 沿 v 合法;刪除後角材 3 沿 u
# 若軸已回未定義會被當第一支 primary 定軸接受——正確行為是拒絕。

boundary 1 outline 0,0 4000,0 4000,3000 0,3000
placement 1 on boundary 1 origin 0 0 2500 u +x v +y

timber 1 27 33 role boundary
place 1 on 1 at-edge e0 +u +n

timber 2 2000 27 33 role primary
place 2 on 1 at 500 500 +v +n

delete timber 2

timber 3 1500 27 33 role primary
place 3 on 1 at 1000 500 +u +n
